"{crew|Capitano|Capitana|Capitani|Capitane}, il giudice vuole ascoltare dei testimoni, non solo il "
"registro."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast in Ulcinj, Mustafa in Castelnuovo and Jele in Kotor saw what the Aga's men did."
msgstr ""
"Albero Storto a Ulcinj, Mustafa a Castelnuovo e Jele a Kotor hanno visto cosa facevano gli uomini "
"dell'Aga."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring all three to Corfu, where the voyage to the judge begins!"
msgstr "Portateli tutti e tre a Corfù, dove comincia il viaggio verso il giudice!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Me, a witness? Ha! Fine."
msgstr "Io, un testimone? Ah! E va bene."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I saw the Aga's men take a tax twice, right at sea."
msgstr "Ho visto gli uomini dell'Aga prendere una tassa due volte, proprio in mare."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I keep the gate of Castelnuovo."
msgstr "Io custodisco la porta di Castelnuovo."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every cart of the Aga's men went through it, twice."
msgstr "Ogni carro degli uomini dell'Aga è passato di lì, due volte."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "They took my olives as a tax, and came back a week later for more."
msgstr "Hanno preso le mie olive come tassa, e una settimana dopo sono tornati a prenderne altre."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will tell the judge everything."
msgstr "Dirò tutto al giudice."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
