#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast? A corsair as a witness... the judge will be surprised!"
msgstr "Albero Storto? Un corsaro come testimone... il giudice resterà a bocca aperta!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mustafa, the gatekeeper. Welcome to Corfu!"
