"Sono pronto, {crew|capitano|capitana|capitani|capitane}. Racconterò al giudice della febbre."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain! I came all the way from Pula."
msgstr "{crew|Capitano|Capitana|Capitani|Capitane}! Sono venuto fin da Pula."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will tell the judge about the Aga's recruiter."
msgstr "Racconterò al giudice del reclutatore dell'Aga."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the ledger and the witnesses to {port}."
