#. what a judge says before the questions, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hmm... unless you answer my riddles. The Count loves riddles."
msgstr "Mmm... a meno che non rispondiate ai miei indovinelli. Il Conte ama gli indovinelli."

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ha! Wrong! Think again, captain."
